invalid type: string "SIZE RECOMMENDATION GUIDE\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nSelecting the correct size improves comfort, appearance, and overall customer satisfaction.\r\n\r\nRequired Measurements\r\n\r\nFor Tops:\r\n- Chest circumference\r\n- Shoulder width\r\n- Height\r\n- Weight\r\n\r\nFor Bottoms:\r\n- Waist circumference\r\n- Hip circumference\r\n- Inseam length\r\n\r\nGeneral Size Chart\r\n\r\nr.\r\n